WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.345
Every chat runs on an orchestrator:

00:00:03.345 --> 00:00:08.207
the engine that decides how the assistant uses its tools and writes its answer.

00:00:08.207 --> 00:00:12.783
This video shows the three orchestrators, how to set up Copilot and Claude

00:00:12.783 --> 00:00:16.100
in the site settings, and how a profile chooses one.

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:23.878
The Default orchestrator is built into the site.

00:00:23.878 --> 00:00:28.880
It uses your own AI connections and deployments, your tools and your knowledge.

00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:34.549
The Copilot orchestrator runs the chat on the GitHub Copilot engine, with a

00:00:34.549 --> 00:00:38.010
GitHub sign-in or with your own model provider key.

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:45.286
The Claude orchestrator runs the chat on Anthropic's Claude engine, with an Anthropic API key.

00:00:45.286 --> 00:00:47.570
Each profile chooses its own.

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:56.392
Open Settings, Artificial Intelligence, and find the Copilot card.

00:00:56.392 --> 00:01:00.492
It appears when the AI Copilot Orchestrator feature is on.

00:01:00.492 --> 00:01:05.360
Authentication type starts at Not configured, which keeps Copilot off.

00:01:05.814 --> 00:01:10.009
GitHub signed-in user asks for the Client ID and the Client secret of

00:01:10.009 --> 00:01:13.869
your GitHub app, and shows the callback address to give GitHub.

00:01:13.869 --> 00:01:16.834
People then use their own Copilot subscription.

00:01:17.284 --> 00:01:21.609
API key, bring your own key, needs no Copilot subscription.

00:01:21.609 --> 00:01:26.200
Choose the Provider type, enter the Base URL and the API key of

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:28.994
the provider, and the Default model.

00:01:29.444 --> 00:01:36.786
Wire API format is Chat completions for most models, and Responses for the GPT-5 series.

00:01:36.786 --> 00:01:40.534
Azure OpenAI also asks for an API version.

00:01:44.718 --> 00:01:47.402
The Claude card works the same way.

00:01:47.402 --> 00:01:51.918
Authentication type is Not configured until you choose API key.

00:01:52.369 --> 00:01:54.454
Enter the Anthropic API key.

00:01:54.454 --> 00:01:58.441
Keep the standard Base URL unless you use your own gateway.

00:01:58.441 --> 00:02:02.549
The Default model is used when a profile does not choose one.

00:02:06.750 --> 00:02:11.950
On a profile, the Orchestrator picker offers Default, Claude and Copilot.

00:02:11.950 --> 00:02:17.480
The orchestrator controls how tools are selected and how the answer loop runs.

00:02:17.930 --> 00:02:20.782
Choose Copilot, and its settings appear.

00:02:20.782 --> 00:02:24.874
When Copilot is not set up on the site, the profile says so:

00:02:24.874 --> 00:02:28.780
it cannot be used until it is configured in the settings.

00:02:29.230 --> 00:02:33.906
Allow all tool executions lets Copilot run its tools without asking.

00:02:33.906 --> 00:02:38.202
Once Copilot is set up, the section also offers a model and an

00:02:38.202 --> 00:02:40.793
Effort level, and a GitHub sign-in.

00:02:40.793 --> 00:02:45.279
A sign-in stored on the profile is lent to every person who chats

00:02:45.279 --> 00:02:47.490
with it, so use it with care.

00:02:47.959 --> 00:02:52.020
Choose Claude, and it also says when it is not configured.

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:56.017
Once it is, a model and an Effort level can be chosen for

00:02:56.017 --> 00:03:00.269
the profile, and an empty model uses the default of the site.

00:03:04.469 --> 00:03:07.093
Start with the Default orchestrator.

00:03:07.093 --> 00:03:12.029
It works with every connection, and with all of your knowledge and tools.

00:03:12.779 --> 00:03:17.099
Choose Copilot or Claude for a profile that needs that engine.

00:03:17.099 --> 00:03:21.229
Set up the credentials first, or the profile cannot answer.

00:03:21.979 --> 00:03:25.890
Keep API keys and client secrets with your technical team.

00:03:25.890 --> 00:03:29.129
They are stored securely and never shown again.

00:03:31.129 --> 00:03:33.371
Pick the engine for each assistant.

00:03:33.371 --> 00:03:37.308
Set up Copilot and Claude once in the settings, and choose them on

00:03:37.308 --> 00:03:39.167
the profiles that need them.

00:03:39.167 --> 00:03:40.589
Thanks for watching.

